From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] evr: export the video format helpers (DXVA colour info, FP16 arrays, media types from BITMAPINFOHEADER/VIDEOINFOHEADER2, MFInitVideoFormat, MFGetUncompressedVideoFormat)

evr.dll exports the same video format helpers as mfplat. Seven of them were
"@ stub" entries; they are now imports forwarded to the mfplat implementations
(MFConvertColorInfoFromDXVA, MFConvertToFP16Array, MFConvertFromFP16Array,
MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromBitMapInfoHeader, MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromVideoInfoHeader2,
MFGetUncompressedVideoFormat, MFInitVideoFormat), like the siblings
MFConvertColorInfoToDXVA and MFInitVideoFormat_RGB already were.
Gate: test/evr-mfexports-gate.sh.
---
diff --git a/dlls/evr/evr.spec b/dlls/evr/evr.spec
index 7383589..ccb48e8 100644
--- a/dlls/evr/evr.spec
+++ b/dlls/evr/evr.spec
@@ -2,16 +2,16 @@
 @ stdcall -private DllGetClassObject(ptr ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall -private DllRegisterServer()
 @ stdcall -private DllUnregisterServer()
-@ stub MFConvertColorInfoFromDXVA
+@ stdcall -import MFConvertColorInfoFromDXVA(ptr long)
 @ stdcall -import MFConvertColorInfoToDXVA(ptr ptr)
-@ stub MFConvertFromFP16Array
-@ stub MFConvertToFP16Array
+@ stdcall -import MFConvertFromFP16Array(ptr ptr long)
+@ stdcall -import MFConvertToFP16Array(ptr ptr long)
 @ stdcall -import MFCopyImage(ptr long ptr long long long)
 @ stdcall -import MFCreateDXSurfaceBuffer(ptr ptr long ptr)
 @ stdcall -import MFCreateVideoMediaType(ptr ptr)
-@ stub MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromBitMapInfoHeader
+@ stdcall -import MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromBitMapInfoHeader(ptr long long long int64 int64 int64 long ptr)
 @ stdcall -import MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromSubtype(ptr ptr)
-@ stub MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromVideoInfoHeader2
+@ stdcall -import MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromVideoInfoHeader2(ptr long int64 ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall -import MFCreateVideoMediaTypeFromVideoInfoHeader(ptr long long long long int64 ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall MFCreateVideoMixer(ptr ptr ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall MFCreateVideoMixerAndPresenter(ptr ptr ptr ptr ptr ptr)
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
 @ stdcall MFCreateVideoSampleFromSurface(ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall -import MFGetPlaneSize(long long long ptr)
 @ stdcall -import MFGetStrideForBitmapInfoHeader(long long ptr)
-@ stub MFGetUncompressedVideoFormat
-@ stub MFInitVideoFormat
+@ stdcall -import MFGetUncompressedVideoFormat(ptr)
+@ stdcall -import MFInitVideoFormat(ptr long)
 @ stdcall -import MFInitVideoFormat_RGB(ptr long long long)
 @ stdcall MFIsFormatYUV(long)
